Subject: [PATCH 07/14] airconv: SM 6.1-6.8 small ops: comparison sampling
 variants, raw gather, packed math, ViewID, start vertex/instance

SampleCmpLevel, SampleCmpBias and SampleCmpGrad map to Metal sample_compare
(gradients through a new reference argument on the gradient sample);
GatherRaw gathers the first channel's bits; dot4add (signed and unsigned),
dot2add and 8-bit pack/unpack are integer math; SV_StartVertexLocation and
SV_StartInstanceLocation read Metal's base vertex and instance; ViewID is 0
(no view instancing). The analysis pass marks the new comparison and gather
opcodes, so their textures get the right Metal type.
